For the brave the direct link is hereÂ to the original tape image on
bitsavers.


........................................................................

(A) Create a Unix version 7 tar archive:

    Chache to the ue500 directory and then:

    $ star artype=v7tar -c -f /tmp/xx.tar h src cmd unix_v7


(B) Create a simh tape file:

    $ cd /tmp
    $ simhtap xx.tar 20 > ue500.tar.tap

    hp(0,0)vmunix
    root device? hp0

    % tar xbf 20 /dev/rmt12
    % cd unix_v7
    % make -f makefile.bsd41


